          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Compute $S_{xx}$ from the $X$ column: $\\sum x=7.5+6.5+6+4.5+9.5=34$, so $\\bar{x}=6.8$. $S_{xx}=(0.7)^2+(-0.3)^2+(-0.8)^2+(-2.3)^2+(2.7)^2=0.49+0.09+0.64+5.29+7.29=13.8$. Standard error of the slope: $\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1.43^2}{13.8}}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{2.0449}{13.8}}=\\sqrt{0.14818}=0.38494$. Since $\\beta_{1,0}=0$: $T_0=\\dfrac{0.56-0}{0.38494}=1.455\\approx1.46$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Tính $S_{xx}$ từ cột $X$: $\\sum x=7{,}5+6{,}5+6+4{,}5+9{,}5=34$, nên $\\bar{x}=6{,}8$. $S_{xx}=0{,}49+0{,}09+0{,}64+5{,}29+7{,}29=13{,}8$. Sai số chuẩn của hệ số góc: $\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1{,}43^2}{13{,}8}}=\\sqrt{0{,}14818}=0{,}38494$. Vì $\\beta_{1,0}=0$: $T_0=\\dfrac{0{,}56-0}{0{,}38494}=1{,}455\\approx1{,}46$.</p></div>"
